## 11. مسیر آزمایش‌های V1.1

### Phase 0 — Data Protocol

- DEAP preprocessed / I-DARE processed EEG/EMG
- Resample to 128Hz
- Strict LOSO
- Validation فقط از train subjects
- Normalization فقط با آمار train subjects

### Phase 1 — EEG-only Baselines

```
R0: OldEncoder + classifier
R1: EEGSegmentClassifier-v1
R2: EEGNet / ShallowConvNet
```

> هدف: تثبیت EEG backbone قبل از اضافه‌کردن EMG و sequence.

### Phase 2 — EEG Sequence Modeling (DEAP)

```
S0: Mean pooling over 12 segment embeddings
S1: Temporal attention pooling
S2: Lightweight TCN + attention pooling    ← default candidate
S3: BiGRU + attention pooling
```

### Phase 3 — EMG Baselines

```
E0: EMG-only segment classifier
E1: EMG-only trial attention model
E2: EMG-only tiny TCN sequence model
```

### Phase 4 — EEG+EMG Fusion

```
F1: Segment-level concat fusion
F2: Segment-level gated fusion
F3: Modality-specific sequence + concat fusion
F4: Modality-specific sequence + gated fusion
```

> مقایسه کلیدی: **F2 vs F4** — آیا fusion در هر 5s window بهتر است یا fusion بعد از sequence encoding هر modality؟

### Phase 5 — I-DARE

```
I1: EEG-only
I2: EMG-only
I3: EEG+EMG concat
I4: EEG+EMG gated
```

> ادعای sequence modeling روی I-DARE مطرح نمی‌شود.

### Phase 6 — Contrastive / Regularization Ablation

```
CE only → CE + Affective SupCon → CE + VREx → CE + SupCon + VREx
```

> Contrastive روی trial-level representation اعمال می‌شود.

---

## 12. Contrastive Learning در V1.1

```
positive:
    same emotion label + different subject
    optionally close continuous rating

hard negative:
    same video/stimulus + different reported emotion
```

> محل اعمال: **trial-level representation** — نه segment-level.

---

## 13. Metrics

```
Accuracy, Macro-F1, Balanced Accuracy
Per-subject accuracy
Mean ± std across LOSO folds
95% CI
Wilcoxon signed-rank برای مقایسه مدل‌های اصلی
```

> برای DEAP، حتماً هم segment-level و هم trial-level reporting باید از هم جدا باشند. نتیجه اصلی باید trial-level باشد.

